{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After moving out of state to live with who is a now ex-partner of yours, you now live alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your town-home feels empty and the ticking of your watch on the bookshelf keeps you company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking with your mom, family and friends aren't quite enough, will you make it out of here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things seem hopeless and the distance and loneliness were enough.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though, it's not so lonely anymore with the company you've discovered. There's no peace of mind and you'll never get out, will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story based game, takes you on a small novelistic adventure into some disturbing scenarios, building up psychological horror aspects and blending it with a story to take with you to bed at night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully the shadows in your room greet you, though, in a manner that is more welcoming.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Go Figure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068910/62fc652349d57cfc3d758f690b86b0a946cffc21.jpg"},{"name":"Rest In Peace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068910/4e09363c50a1f7cd9a8ef563aeb75e4aaf1363e8.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068910?t=1773984182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068910?t=1773984182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068910/11e407a0955cb3082ff634eca17ac53fd3f34a0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773984182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068910/11e407a0955cb3082ff634eca17ac53fd3f34a0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773984182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id